config BIST_HD_TEST_STARVE_AGENT
	bool "Starve the Host Diagnostic Agent past the challenge window"
	help
	  The application becomes cooperative above the agent thread priority and
	  busy-waits, so no ANSWER reaches the companion before the window
	  expires. The ESP-BIST library is built exactly as a product would build
	  it; the fault comes from this app.

